        "coaching_tips": [
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Men need to give and have their gift received. They also need appreciation, admiration, respect and love, but most of all, respect."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "When you're receiving from a man, let him know that you respect him."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Sometimes, allow him to give to you without giving back to him. I know this is hard, but he wants to give to you."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "For example: when it's your birthday and he gives you a gift, you don't have to give him one back. It's your birthday, not his, so just remember, every day is your birthday."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "You were born to be loved and adored. receive his touch. Be like a pet who needs love and attention, show appreciation by your smile and glow, not by \"doing for him\", but \"just by being.\""
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "You'll \"be\" the object of his affection. Say \"thank you\" even if it's uncomfortable. Say \"thank you\" sometimes without reciprocating the compliment."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Obviously, you will want to compliment him too, at times. Pause, say thank you, smile, hug, purr, wiggle, wink, play with your hair...be juicy!"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Notice that you may feel uncomfortable receiving a compliment or action from a man without giving him one in return."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Practice it with everyone you meet. It is actually a sign of self-respect when you can simply receive without the \"false sense of urgency\" to give back or make excuses about why you weren't worthy of the compliment."
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
